<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_appendix"><a href="#A11" title="In BrowserArena: Evaluating LLM Agents on Real-World Web Navigation Tasks" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">K </span>Pop-Up Banner Closure Scenarios</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_appendix"><a href="#A12" title="In BrowserArena: Evaluating LLM Agents on Real-World Web Navigation Tasks" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">L </span>Direct Navigation Actions Taken</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_appendix"><a href="#A13" title="In BrowserArena: Evaluating LLM Agents on Real-World Web Navigation Tasks" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">M </span>Examples of User-Submitted Tasks</span></a></li>
</ol></nav>
