<section id="A13" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix M </span>Examples of User-Submitted Tasks</h2>

<div id="A13.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A13.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A13.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Task Prompt 1:</span> Find me the last available train from Cardiff Central to Barry Docks station today on trainline.</p>
</div>
<div id="A13.p2" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A13.p2.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A13.p2.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Task Prompt 2:</span> Compare flight prices from washington DC to Paris france to flights from washington DC to Kyoto Japan</p>
</div>
</section>
